      ],
      "source": "https://www.tshaonline.org/handbook/entries/jacinto-city-tx",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "The first public library opened in 1958 on Mercury Drive, a building that once served as the city hall.",
